# Vitest tests (`tests/`)

New unit tests live under `tests/`, not colocated next to source. Mirror the module path under `src/` (`src/shared/projects.ts` → `tests/shared/projects.test.ts`).

## Stack

- Vitest (`npm test` / `npm run test:watch`); config is `vitest.config.mts`
- Import app code via `@/` (`@/shared/projects`)
- Node environment. Do not boot Vite for unit tests. Do not hit live APIs

## Style

- Name files `*.test.ts`
- One `describe` per unit under test; `it` names state the behavior
- Prefer `toMatchObject` over catching by hand

```ts
// tests/shared/projects.test.ts
expect(getProjectsByExperienceId("wipro")).toEqual([])
```

Do not add colocated `src/**/*.test.ts` specs.

Archived prompt helpers (`@src/server/ai/context.ts`, `@src/lib/contactCta.ts`) still have tests. Keep them if those modules stay.
